---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ExternalLink from "../components/ExternalLink.astro";
import SiteNav from "../components/SiteNav.astro";
---

<Base>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="main">
      <div class="main__logo">
        <img src="/assets/images/logo.jpg" alt="Studio Lokal Logo" />
      </div>
      <div class="main__content">
        <SiteNav />
        <h1>lokal</h1>
        <p>
          인간적인 기술과 소프트웨어를 연구합니다.
        </p>

        <p>
          <ExternalLink href="https://nosanjae.kr"><b>일하다 죽지 않을 직장 찾기</b></ExternalLink>
          <br /><br />
          <ExternalLink href="https://openwatch.kr"><b>오픈와치 (https://openwatch.kr)</b></ExternalLink>
          <br /><br />
          <ExternalLink href="https://sluggish.at"><b>슬러기시 해커스 커뮤니티 모임</b></ExternalLink>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
